# PC 1: N1 <= n: block read argument N1 (2 words) -> fm_arg (278). Else block read 6 words at
#       SP - 2 (n - 1) -> fm_go (279), which loads A, B, C and calls the core.
# PC 2 (back from CELL_GET, A = cell value): block write A over argument N1 -> PC 1 (re-examined).
# PC 3 (from fm_arg or ev_t2n): block write fix(A) over argument N1, N1 += 1 -> PC 1, where
#       fix keeps tags 0, 1, 3, 4, turns 8 (missing) into blank and anything else into #VALUE!.
